(7537852, 1206184, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very punny title. The dark areas are really dark, but I''m sure that''s just the way they looked. The votive candles show up nicely, though.</td>', 'Very punny title. The dark areas are really dark, but I''m sure that''s just the way they looked. The votive candles show up nicely, though.', '2017-10-04 14:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
