(7538020, 1206119, 147314, '<td valign="top">What an imposing animal. Really well exposed, leaving just enough details in the white areas.</td>', 'What an imposing animal. Really well exposed, leaving just enough details in the white areas.', '2017-10-05 18:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7538022, 1206151, 147314, '<td valign="top">This is an intriguing image. To me it looks like a creative sort of child wish, hence the use of a doll. But its that same doll that puts me off, it kind of ruins the image. But Im also touched by the sadness that speaks from this image. Lot of emotions raised by this image, so overall feeling is that it must be a good one. Bump!</td>', 'This is an intriguing image. To me it looks like a creative sort of child wish, hence the use of a doll. But its that same doll that puts me off, it kind of ruins the image. But Im also touched by the sadness that speaks from this image. Lot of emotions raised by this image, so overall feeling is that it must be a good one. Bump!', '2017-10-05 18:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
