(7538396, 1206151, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like your use of window light mixed with studio light--my vote was for the light. The subject, the story, was hard for me to grasp. A woman in a non-cosy space attempting, or pretending, to suckle a doll...seems insane, &amp; the IV needles suggest that her health care giver is insane, or delusional, or a poet...the whole thing made me feel uncomfortable but the light was so nice I kept looking. Interesting experience.</td>', 'I like your use of window light mixed with studio light--my vote was for the light. The subject, the story, was hard for me to grasp. A woman in a non-cosy space attempting, or pretending, to suckle a doll...seems insane, & the IV needles suggest that her health care giver is insane, or delusional, or a poet...the whole thing made me feel uncomfortable but the light was so nice I kept looking. Interesting experience.', '2017-10-08 01:38:16.000000', NULL, 0),
