(7538444, 1206136, 173844, '<td valign="top">Achingly beautiful, and my favorite in the challenge though I didn''t leave comments.  The mood and the moment are extraordinary, accomplished with such a minimal palette.  It''s a wonderful addition to your visual diary of the landscape of your days, so many of which have moved me.</td>', 'Achingly beautiful, and my favorite in the challenge though I didn''t leave comments.  The mood and the moment are extraordinary, accomplished with such a minimal palette.  It''s a wonderful addition to your visual diary of the landscape of your days, so many of which have moved me.', '2017-10-08 12:28:05.000000', NULL, 0),
