(7538454, 1206125, 185755, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MaryO:</b></div><hr/><i> Disturbing story being told here. Poor bug. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hello MaryO,<br/> <br/>Well..agree with you, Mary. Precisely disturbing to see the weevil in distress. The weaver ants held on ever sooo tightly to the weevil''s legs. Tried to shoo the ants but it never budge at all. Finally, we find ways to release the weevil from the grasp of death. Saw the weevil happily flew off to freedom. That''s my real bug''s story : )<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-10-08 12:19:37.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by MaryO: Disturbing story being told here. Poor bug.   Hello MaryO, Well..agree with you, Mary. Precisely disturbing to see the weevil in distress. The weaver ants held on ever sooo tightly to the weevil''s legs. Tried to shoo the ants but it never budge at all. Finally, we find ways to release the weevil from the grasp of death. Saw the weevil happily flew off to freedom. That''s my real bug''s story : )', '2017-10-08 13:18:07.000000', '2017-10-08 13:19:37.000000', 0),
