(7538581, 1206240, 138630, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the 10 and the comment, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=38162" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">oldbimmercoupe</a>  That makes me sad.  I found it beautiful, and I really did not consider the possibility of "political" votes when I entered LOL  Would have entered anyway - it was a very moving ceremony.<br/> <br/>And thanks for the in voting support, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=100831" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">PennyStreet</a>  Really appreciate that.</td>', 'Thanks for the 10 and the comment,  oldbimmercoupe  That makes me sad.  I found it beautiful, and I really did not consider the possibility of "political" votes when I entered LOL  Would have entered anyway - it was a very moving ceremony. And thanks for the in voting support,  PennyStreet  Really appreciate that.', '2017-10-09 00:48:11.000000', NULL, 0),
