(7538608, 1206151, 181331, '<td valign="top">I should of explained more about the photo, but I wanted the picture to tell the story. <br/>First, thanks a lot for all the reviewers and comments. The concept here is a mother who cannot feed her child with her own milk and pumping in artificial milk, with the hope of survival. <br/> <br/>Obviously, we cannot make it too real, but try to make it as much realistic as possible without distracting the original concept. <br/> <br/>Getting a such a young kid is challenging and risk also for us hence we used a doll in place of a baby.</td>', 'I should of explained more about the photo, but I wanted the picture to tell the story. First, thanks a lot for all the reviewers and comments. The concept here is a mother who cannot feed her child with her own milk and pumping in artificial milk, with the hope of survival.  Obviously, we cannot make it too real, but try to make it as much realistic as possible without distracting the original concept.  Getting a such a young kid is challenging and risk also for us hence we used a doll in place of a baby.', '2017-10-09 04:49:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538609, 1205773, 181331, '<td valign="top">Congrats Chris</td>', 'Congrats Chris', '2017-10-09 04:55:22.000000', NULL, 0),
