(7538617, 1206213, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue. Awesome!</td>', 'Congrats on the blue. Awesome!', '2017-10-09 07:56:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538620, 1206193, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge<br/> <br/>This is a nice piece of observation, you feel as though you are peering into their secret world. Your composition is good it shows off the building in which they are working to advantage with lots of interesting detail. I like your mono processing there is a good range of tones and the exposure itself is all good. A nice piece of work, thanks for sharing Michelle.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge This is a nice piece of observation, you feel as though you are peering into their secret world. Your composition is good it shows off the building in which they are working to advantage with lots of interesting detail. I like your mono processing there is a good range of tones and the exposure itself is all good. A nice piece of work, thanks for sharing Michelle.', '2017-10-09 08:54:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538622, 1206151, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge<br/> <br/>Wow Srikanth, this is a powerful image! Perhaps your image didnt quite tell the story as accurately as you hope for but I think the title together with the doll tells it all for me, it speaks of motherhood and a yearning for a child of her own she can nurture. Her pose and expression for me confirms all that and has already been noted the lighting works really well. I think this is a great concept very well executed.<br/> <br/>I am also very impressed with your Masters of Wisdom image, another very strong concept that works well, keep up the excellent work Srikanth</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge Wow Srikanth, this is a powerful image! Perhaps your image didnt quite tell the story as accurately as you hope for but I think the title together with the doll tells it all for me, it speaks of motherhood and a yearning for a child of her own she can nurture. Her pose and expression for me confirms all that and has already been noted the lighting works really well. I think this is a great concept very well executed. I am also very impressed with your Masters of Wisdom image, another very strong concept that works well, keep up the excellent work Srikanth', '2017-10-09 09:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538623, 1205678, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge<br/> <br/>A great image Jonathon. Ok, so we dont have perfect symmetry but you have made a very good job of what must have been a difficult situation. What makes the image work so well is the clarity of detail and what a lot of interesting detail there is to absorb. The overall exposure is good the colours are well saturated against the near pastels of the plainer (if such a word can be used here!) surfaces. A great job, well done</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge A great image Jonathon. Ok, so we dont have perfect symmetry but you have made a very good job of what must have been a difficult situation. What makes the image work so well is the clarity of detail and what a lot of interesting detail there is to absorb. The overall exposure is good the colours are well saturated against the near pastels of the plainer (if such a word can be used here!) surfaces. A great job, well done', '2017-10-09 09:10:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538624, 1206162, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge<br/> <br/>A great documentary image that I can see in your clients brochure. Obviously for such a commission you want to record accurate detail in a neutral sort of way, I think you have achieved that well. There is good DOF throughout, I assume the colour cast is as seen within the room. It all looks very medical and a quite intimidating machine</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge A great documentary image that I can see in your clients brochure. Obviously for such a commission you want to record accurate detail in a neutral sort of way, I think you have achieved that well. There is good DOF throughout, I assume the colour cast is as seen within the room. It all looks very medical and a quite intimidating machine', '2017-10-09 09:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538625, 1206203, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge<br/> <br/>Your title may well be the name of the place if so, it is very appropriate. The scene looks very tranquil and peaceful, the sort of place you would like to while away the time at. Your composition is good with the road leading you into the farm below in an inviting sort of way. Although the lighting is quite frontal you have quite a nice 3D effect. It all works very well, well seen and captured Janine</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge Your title may well be the name of the place if so, it is very appropriate. The scene looks very tranquil and peaceful, the sort of place you would like to while away the time at. Your composition is good with the road leading you into the farm below in an inviting sort of way. Although the lighting is quite frontal you have quite a nice 3D effect. It all works very well, well seen and captured Janine', '2017-10-09 09:19:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7538633, 1205773, 135744, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and really super photo. I love the way the net creates a texture over the boat and man. Wonderful photography. Congrats!</td>', 'Wonderful composition and really super photo. I love the way the net creates a texture over the boat and man. Wonderful photography. Congrats!', '2017-10-09 11:57:37.000000', NULL, 0),
